===============================================================================
Quranic text (Arabic)
===============================================================================

The Arabic text is the Uthmani script edition (quran-uthmani), retrieved from
the AlQuran Cloud API at https://alquran.cloud and stored in
AyahWidget/Verses.json.

===============================================================================
English translation
===============================================================================

The English rendering is the Saheeh International translation (en.sahih),
retrieved from the same API. The Saheeh International translation is the
copyrighted work of its publisher and is included here for the purpose of
reading and reflection. It is not placed under this project's MIT license.

